115
00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.100
That sound good?

116
00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.493
Yeah, great.

117
00:05:20.975 --> 00:05:23.000
Thank you for having us.

118
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.450
We're going to, obviously if we could be so lucky

119
00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.730
to have each and every one of you

120
00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:29.160 line:15%
up on our website, it's thedrewbarrymoreshow.com,

121
00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.150 line:15%
shining lights on your businesses.

122
00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:34.500 line:15%
We love all of you and everything that you're doing

123
00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.900
in your business communities as well

124
00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:39.723
