125
00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.020
Thank you so much.

126
00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:45.940
But Drew, you know what would be good?

127
00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:50.163
If we did an exclusive Slim and Husky's special cookie.

128
00:05:51.115 --> 00:05:53.014
(cheering and applause)

129
00:05:53.014 --> 00:05:55.940
We like that, we love that.

130
00:05:55.940 --> 00:06:00.070
I'm so grateful to Clint and EJ and Derek

131
00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:03.470
